  m_text: 'This room represents the part of my mind that comes out when I''m having
    fun. It''s energetic, unpredictable, and sometimes a little out of control.


    But
    in here, you get to decide what happens.


    Close this panel and click the
    disco ball to see how the crowd reacts. Keep clicking to discover what else you
    can make them do.'
