  m_text: 'EST. SOMEWHERE IN MY HEAD

    GIGI''S

    Daily Menu

    _________________________


    STARTERS

    Beef
    Carpaccio


    Truffle, parmesan, lemon, crispy capers, pickled shallots.


    Charred
    Broccoli


    Soy-garlic glaze, sesame, lemon, parmesan.


    Lamb Dumplings


    Sumac,
    crispy garlic, soy butter, yogurt on request.


    Pickle Plate


    An unnecessarily
    large selection of pickled vegetables.

    _________________________________________________________


    MAINS

    Filet
    Mignon


    Truffle-rosemary jus, thick-cut fries, pickle aioli.


    Crispy
    Chicken & Rice


    Mushroom-soy glaze, garlic fried rice, charred broccoli.


    Tuna
    Crispy Rice


    Avocado, truffle soy, sesame, pickled cucumber.


    Rosemary
    Lamb


    Lemon-sumac potatoes, roasted eggplant, olive oil jus.



    _________________________________________


'
