    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'SIDES

    Truffle Parmesan Fries


    Thick-cut fries, shaved parmesan,
    black truffle.


    Crispy Rice


    Soy glaze, sesame, scallions, chili oil.


    Roasted
    Mushrooms


    Garlic, rosemary, olive oil, lemon.


    House Pickles


    Cucumber,
    carrots, peppers, olives. Served in excessive quantities.


    _________________________________________________________



    DESSERT

    Classic
    Tiramisu


    Espresso, mascarpone, cocoa.


    Vanilla Ice Cream


    Madagascar
    vanilla, olive oil, flaky sea salt.

    _________________________________________________________


    DRINKS

    Extra
    Dirty Martini


    Vodka or gin, extra olive brine, 33 olives.


    House Red


    A
    rotating selection of French and Italian reds.



    __________________________________________________'
